{"id":16942,"name":"Hamilton County","slug":"hamilton-county","state":"Ohio","code":"OH","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/hamilton-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:14","facts":{"redemptionPeriod":"12 months","interestRate":"Up to 18%, bid down","bidProcedure":"Bid Down Interest Rate","deposit":"$500 registration fee, 10% of purchase price","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Usually in October"},{"label":"Payment Requirements","value":"Balance within five business days"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Hamilton County RealAuction"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"Izom1ijlHvb7Pa2d0B5JhY6VAw4EpgQ9DR\"><iframe title=\"Which is more profitable: Tax Lien or Tax Deed Sales? - Hamilton County - Ohio Tax Lien &amp; Deed Inves\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3hAJ0OX8vrk?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-tax-lien-vs-tax-deed-which-yields-higher-profits-in-hamilton-county-ohio\">Tax Lien vs. Tax Deed: Which Yields Higher Profits in Hamilton County, Ohio?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>In Hamilton County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ohio</mark></a>, Tax Lien Certificate Sales and Tax Deed Sales present fantastic opportunities for savvy investors. This dynamic county, anchored by Cincinnati, is the third-most populous in Ohio, offering a fertile ground for both high returns and low entry costs. Let’s explore the ins and outs of these investment avenues!</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-understanding-tax-lien-certificates-and-tax-deeds\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates and Tax Deeds</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Lien Certificates</strong>: When you buy a tax lien certificate, you’re essentially purchasing the right to collect unpaid property taxes. The county holds an online auction where bidders compete for the lowest interest rate, starting at 18%. If the property owner redeems the lien, you earn the interest rate bid. If not, you may eventually foreclose on the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Deeds</strong>: This involves purchasing properties directly at a tax sale. If the property owner fails to pay their taxes, the property is sold at a Sheriff&#8217;s sale, often for the amount of back taxes owed plus expenses. Full payment is required at the time of sale.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-steps-to-start-investing-in-tax-liens-or-tax-deeds-in-hamilton-county\">Steps to Start Investing in Tax Liens or Tax Deeds in Hamilton County</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong>: Knowing the legal framework is crucial. Each state and county has unique regulations affecting tax lien and deed sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer’s Website</strong>: This is where you&#8217;ll find essential tax sale information. Check Hamilton County&#8217;s Treasurer’s Office for updates.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong>: Hamilton County’s auctions are conducted online. Visit <a href=\"https://hamilton.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Hamilton County Sheriff’s Sale Auction</mark></a> for details.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Read the Details</strong>: Make sure to understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiry, and other critical details before participating.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Contact the County Office</strong>: For any additional inquiries, reach out to the local office. Here are some useful links:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://apps.hcso.org/community-services/search-property-sales/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Hamilton County Tax Lien Information</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hamiltoncountyohio.gov/government/departments/treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Hamilton County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hcso.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Hamilton County Sheriff’s Office</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-important-details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Downtown-—-City-of-Hamilton-County-OH-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-16948 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Downtown — City of Hamilton County, OH\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-id=\"16948\"  > </picture></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-pro-tips-in-hamilton-county-tax-sale\">Pro Tips in Hamilton County Tax Sale</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Thoroughly</strong>: Know the property and its market value before bidding.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Attend Auctions</strong>: Even if you&#8217;re not bidding, attend to learn the process.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Prepare Financially</strong>: Ensure you have the necessary funds readily available.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-attractions-and-economic-highlights\">Attractions and Economic Highlights</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Popular Attractions</strong>: Hamilton County offers parks, theatres, and historic sites, enriching its community appeal.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Transportation Infrastructure</strong>: With extensive roads, rail systems, and the Cincinnati/Northern Kentucky International Airport, getting around is convenient.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Economic Development</strong>: Key sectors include technology, manufacturing, and a growing startup ecosystem.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Community Appeal</strong>: Enjoy outdoor activities, vibrant nightlife, and historical explorations in this lively county.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-faqs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>What are Tax Certificates?</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Tax certificates transfer the state’s first and superior lien on a delinquent parcel to the purchaser, who then earns interest until the lien is redeemed or can foreclose on the property​ (<a href=\"https://www.hamiltoncountyohio.gov/government/departments/treasurer/faq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Hamilton County, Ohio</mark></a>)​.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>How do I participate in an auction?</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Register online, pay the deposit, and prepare for bidding. Details are on the <a href=\"https://hamilton.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Hamilton County RealAuction website</mark></a>​.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What happens if the property doesn’t sell?</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It may be re-offered or become forfeited land, eventually sold through traditional methods or special land sales by the auditor​​.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Useful Links</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://apps.hcso.org/community-services/search-property-sales/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Tax Lien Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hamiltoncountyohio.gov/government/departments/treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hcso.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Sheriff’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://hamilton.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County RealAuction</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Need a Hand?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need more guidance on tax lien investing, feel free to <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">reach out</mark></a> for a consultation!</p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}